    dict(spec="0022", round=7, kind="external", date="2026-08-17", verdict="SENT (the coupled round-7 package `0022-0023-v7`; 0004 remains OUT — approved and frozen; PRIOR EXTERNAL REPORTS ARE NOT INCLUDED, per the reviewer's explicit instruction, with the structured closure ledger as the agreed replacement). 0022 at v8: R6-1 the rollback boundary is BaseException on both sides with the KeyboardInterrupt injection as a regression (18 harness checks); R6-2 the stale 'verbatim withdrawn' carrier deleted; R6-3 the ledger is VALIDATED against reviews.py rather than maintained beside it — ids extracted from verdict text, every one required, 26 findings with runnable evidence; R6-4 the launcher calls runtime_supported() and refuses with exit 2, proven against a forced-False build", findings=0),
