    dict(spec="0022", round=5, kind="external", date="2026-08-17", verdict="SENT (the coupled round-5 package `0022-0023-v5`; 0004 remains OUT — approved, frozen). 0022 at v6: R4-1 folded — the shared operation now APPLIES EVERY EFFECT in the same transaction, stores the operator's reason and timestamp, requires `plan`, and rolls the row back with the effects on any fault; six new checks, and reverting to the old behaviour fails two of them. R4-3: the closure ledger is GENERATED from reviews.py with a --check gate. R4-4: the skip renderer raises on any category it would drop, the decomposition is COMPUTED from the sealed -rs output, and reconcile() has shipped tests", findings=0),
